		(uuid "dcfa7324-7222-4f00-971d-b50932a37e9b")
		(at 99.5 71)
		(descr "1206 reverse-mount LED that shines THROUGH the board (no hole): the lens faces the PCB and lights bare FR4 from behind. Keep copper off both sides inside a 1.6 mm radius of the centre. Lite-On LTST-C230KRKT (red, LCSC C125107) and family. Pads per KiCad LED_SMD:LED_1206_3216Metric_ReverseMount. Pad 1 = cathode, pad 2 = anode.")
